DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuddssbbrr driver provides support for the D-Link DSB-R100 USB radio.

     The device is accessed through the radio(4) driver.

     The DSB-R100 is a rather poor radio and the only feedback that you can
     get from the radio is if it has a stereo signal or not.

